# 디스코드 봇 (/구인 · /구인글 · /전적 ...). 사이트와 같은 서버에서 따로 돈다
# 설치: sudo cp deploy/carrygg-bot.service /etc/systemd/system/ && sudo systemctl enable --now carrygg-bot
[Unit]
Description=carry.gg Discord bot
After=network-online.target carrygg.service
Wants=network-online.target

[Service]
User=carrygg
WorkingDirectory=/opt/carrygg
Environment=LOLGG_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000
ExecStart=/opt/carrygg/venv/bin/python scripts/discord_bot.py
Restart=always
RestartSec=10
NoNewPrivileges=true
ProtectSystem=full
PrivateTmp=true

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
